.blheli32proxy/
*.pcap
*keylog*.txt

# This project tracks its own AI-instruction files (referenced from README.md/PLAN.md),
# overriding the user's global ~/.gitignore exclusion of them.
!AGENTS.md
!CLAUDE.md
